The Go port changes model ownership, concurrency, storage, bounds, and the public
API. It adds permanent freezing and explicit resource errors instead of LRU
eviction. Regex and Unicode semantics use the Go standard library.

The Rust upstream identifies logpai/Drain3 as the algorithm and test-compatibility
reference. Its MIT attribution is retained in third_party/logpai-Drain3-LICENSE.txt:
